---
<main id="main"><section class="reference-intro"><nav class="breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/index.html">Home</a><span>/</span><span>Your reading library</span></nav><p class="eyebrow">RETURN TO A STORY</p><h1>Your reading library</h1><p>Saved stories, chapter bookmarks and the stories you have marked as read. Your library stays in this browser; it is not synced between devices.</p></section>
<section class="section reading-library" aria-label="Personal reading library"><div class="library-controls" hidden><label for="library-view">Show <select id="library-view"><option value="all">All your stories</option><option value="progress">Continue reading</option><option value="saved">Saved &amp; bookmarked</option><option value="completed">Marked as read</option></select></label><p id="library-count" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p></div><p id="library-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p><div id="library-list"></div><div id="library-empty" hidden><h2>A place for your next chapter.</h2><p>Open a story and begin reading, save a story, or bookmark a chapter. It will appear here.</p><a href="/stories.html">Find a story →</a></div>
<details class="library-browse" open><summary>Browse all stories</summary><ul>{% for id, item in storyCatalog %}<li><a href="{{ item.href }}">{{ item.title }}</a><span>{{ item.minutes }} min read</span></li>{% endfor %}</ul></details>
<section class="library-transfer reader-panel" hidden aria-labelledby="backup-title"><p class="eyebrow">TAKE YOUR PLACE WITH YOU</p><h2 id="backup-title">A backup for another browser</h2><p>Export your saved stories, chapter bookmarks and reading-path progress. Importing merges a backup with this browser’s library; existing saved and completed stories are kept.</p><button id="library-export" type="button">Download library backup</button><label for="library-import">Import a library backup <span>(JSON, up to 1 MB)</span></label><input id="library-import" type="file" accept=".json,application/json"><p id="library-transfer-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p><details><summary>Clear this browser’s reading history</summary><p>This removes saved stories, bookmarks and completion from this browser. Download a backup first if you want to keep them. Your theme and text size are kept.</p><button id="library-clear" type="button">Clear reading history</button></details></section>
<noscript><p>Your personal library needs JavaScript. All stories remain available above.</p></noscript></section></main>
